Mealybug_mitochondrial_tRNA_mirrors 

Summary

Analysis of the mitochondrial tRNAs in the citrus mealybug Planococcus citri based on full-length tRNA sequencing (YAMAT-seq), MSR-seq, mitoribosome tRNA-seq, and genomic DNA sequencing.

The main workflow for read processing and analysis is in each respective experimental directory.

Raw Data Availability

Raw sequencing data can be found on NCBI SRA BioProject PRJNA1356551

Reference

Warren, JM, , Prasad, KVSK, Mendez, AM, Temnyk, S, Expression of four mitochondrial tRNAs from only two loci,  bioRxiv preprint
